WEBVTT

00:06:58.676 --> 00:07:00.116
I want to say,

00:07:00.156 --> 00:07:03.876
instead of inviting youth
for the photo ops and the applause,

00:07:03.916 --> 00:07:06.796
offer us a seat during
the brainstorming meetings,

00:07:06.836 --> 00:07:10.116
during the internal workshops
with no audience.

00:07:10.156 --> 00:07:12.276
Maybe invite us
to one of your board meetings

00:07:12.316 --> 00:07:15.316
and ask us for some
reverse mentoring sessions.

00:07:15.756 --> 00:07:17.436
You might be surprised.

00:07:17.996 --> 00:07:21.316
I look back at the last 10 years

00:07:21.356 --> 00:07:27.476
and see an intense journey
from a young cute girl to a changemaker.

00:07:27.476 --> 00:07:28.996
For the next decade,

00:07:29.036 --> 00:07:31.956
I see a whole generation that is rising,